  "title": "Qt: Increase ring buffer file number limit",
  "description": "Notes:\n1. Wireshark internal max limit for ring buffer files is 100,000 (ringbuffer.h)\n2. Wireshark internal limit before warning the user is 65,535 (ringbuffer.h)\n3. GTK: The old GUI did not limit the value for this parameter\n4. Qt: This value was limited to 1,000\n\nChange:\nSet the GUI limit to match the warning limit (65,535)",
